Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
==========================================================

Applies to: the data distributed with this repository, namely

  * data/ada_reference.csv        the 289-drug clinical reference table
  * data/ada_label_priors.csv     the label-derived priors
  * data/extra_protein_ada.csv, data/extra_protein_sequences.csv
  * paper/benchmark_composite.csv and the other files under paper/ that
    contain data or results (manuscripts and figures excluded)
  * data/germlines/               the bundled IMGT human V-gene pool

